{"id":"5442","groups":[{"type":"pnri","label":"相关图像","images":[{"src":"/images/compressed/5442_main_22-halo-and-upper-tangent-arc_photometeors.JPG","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc1\"><p>“切弧”是与其它晕相切的几类发光弧的通用术语。图中，切弧在其最高点触及<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">22°晕</span>，因此，它是<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">上切弧</span>。</p>\n<p>切弧的形状随光源（太阳或月亮）的角高度而变化。当光源正处于地平线之上时，上切弧呈窄V字形。随着太阳或月亮在空中升起， V字形上切弧打开呈大鹏展翅状。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© Alfons Puertas","location":"西班牙，巴塞罗那，Vallvidrera - el Tibidabo i les Planes","latitude":"纬度: 41° 25' 6'' N","longitude":"经度: 2° 7' 27'' E","date":"25 October 2015 0820 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向东","cloudCode":"","code":"图像P/S代码: P.13.1.4","imageId":"图像P/S代码: P.13.1.4"}]},{"type":"seci","label":"其他图像","images":[{"src":"/images/compressed/4796_main_halo-display_photometeors.jpg","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc2\"><p>这张南极洲极端广角照片显示了一个<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">22°光晕</span>，有两个假日或太阳狗，位于两侧<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">2</span>和<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">3</span>处。绕着地平线，水平地穿过幻日和太阳是<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">4</span>和<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">5</span>处的幻日环。在22°光晕的顶部和底部是<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">上切线弧</span>和<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">下切线弧</span>，它们围绕22°光环延伸，作为微弱的发光曲线彼此相交并形成外接光晕。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© Tatsuru Fujita","location":"日本千叶县 260-0855千叶市中央区1-1 Ichibachō","latitude":"纬度: 77° 19' 12'' S","longitude":"经度: 39° 42' 0'' E","date":"24 December 2004 1328 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向东北","cloudCode":"","code":"图像P/S代码: S.13.1.1 6","imageId":"图像P/S代码: S.13.1.1 6"}]}]}